:59:25Z","updated_at":"2017-06-12T15:59:45Z","body":"We do not have an ETA for this. It's preferable to fix this on the client side as a defensive measure. However if you're aware of your manifest server generating invalid manifests, you should really fix the problem on the server side at which point this becomes a non-issue. We have multiple large third party providers using ExoPlayer, who simply don't encounter this issue because their servers do the right thing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/307834413/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/310036914","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2795#issuecomment-310036914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2795","id":310036914,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMxMDAzNjkxNA==","user":{"login":"jpardogo","id":117222